title: What I am unsure of
pid: d4fae331-e6b0-4500-8b42-6b86708cf0f6
body: |2-
  Whether Jeff wants a replied message filed at the end of his copy, or
  at the start, or straight into 'maybe done'; I chose the end. Whether
  a message should also count as touched when he only edits it without
  replying (it does now, by the same rule). And his old replies, made
  before this, stay as they were: forks no note holds, their messages
  still counted unread until he files or hides them.
